<title>FINLAND: FINNISH POSTIPANKKI'S PSP-RAHOITUS 96 PROFIT FALLS.</title>
<headline>FINNISH POSTIPANKKI'S PSP-RAHOITUS 96 PROFIT FALLS.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to Dec 31,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Operating profit				  36.7 vs 43.3</p>
<p> Income on financial operations		74.7 vs 79.0</p>
<p> Balance sheet total			  2,235.2 vs 1,888.8</p>
<p> Write-offs on credits and guarantees	 1.4 vs 0.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish financing company is</p>
<p>PSP-Rahoitus Oy. It is fully owned subsidiary of state-owned</p>
<p>bank group Postipankki Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0248</p>
</text>
